msgstr "Captain Assistant"

msgid "plugins.generic.chatwootIntegration.settings.chatwootCaptainAssistantId.description"
msgstr "The Chatwoot Captain assistant this journal's Knowledge Document, Custom Tools, and Scenarios should be provisioned under. Required for Sync/Repair Captain to do anything — without it, Captain provisioning silently does nothing."

