msgstr "Test Connection &amp; Discover"

msgid "plugins.generic.chatwootIntegration.settings.discover.description"
msgstr "Verifies your Base URL and API Access Token against Chatwoot, then discovers the accounts, Website Inboxes, and Captain Assistants available to this token — no numeric IDs to look up by hand."

